sequenceDiagram
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant Device as Perangkat
    participant TG as Telegram API
    participant ChMitra as Channel Mitra
    participant ChPusat as Channel Pusat

    Note over Scheduler,ChPusat: HKN-011→012→013→014→015: Proses Backup Otomatis (Sequential Include)

    Scheduler->>BE: Trigger backup sesuai jadwal
    activate BE
    
    Note over BE,Device: HKN-011: Backup via SSH
    BE->>BE: Ambil kredensial & init SSH (Netmiko)
    BE->>Device: SSH Connect & execute backup command
    activate Device
    Device-->>BE: Return file konfigurasi
    deactivate Device
    Note over BE: Simpan file ke storage lokal
    
    Note over BE,DB: HKN-012: Deteksi Perubahan
    BE->>DB: Hitung hash & compare dengan versi sebelumnya
    activate DB
    DB-->>BE: Hash comparison result
    deactivate DB
    Note over BE: SHA256 hash detection
    
    alt Hash Berbeda (Ada Perubahan)
        Note over BE,DB: HKN-013: Simpan Versi dengan Timestamp
        BE->>DB: Insert backup record<br/>(timestamp, hash, device_id, config_text)
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Return backup_id
        deactivate DB
        
        Note over BE,ChPusat: HKN-014: Upload ke Channel Telegram
        BE->>BE: Compress file (gzip), split jika >50MB
        BE->>TG: Upload file backup
        activate TG
        TG->>ChMitra: Send to channel mitra
        activate ChMitra
        deactivate ChMitra
        TG->>ChPusat: Send to channel pusat
        activate ChPusat
        deactivate ChPusat
        Note over TG,ChPusat: Isolasi data per mitra
        
        Note over BE,ChPusat: HKN-015: Kirim Notifikasi Status
        BE->>TG: Send notification (device, timestamp, size)
        TG->>ChMitra: Backup berhasil
        activate ChMitra
        deactivate ChMitra
        TG->>ChPusat: Backup berhasil
        activate ChPusat
        deactivate ChPusat
        deactivate TG
        
    else Hash Sama (Tidak Ada Perubahan)
        BE->>BE: Skip upload
        Note over BE: Log: "No configuration changes"
    end
    deactivate BE
